.TH "PACE WELLNESS" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace wellness Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-wellness \- Daily health metrics.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace wellness
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Daily health metrics.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBtoday\fP
  Daily summary (steps, calories, distance,...
  See \fBpace wellness-today(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBtoday\fP command.
.PP
\fBsleep\fP
  Sleep duration and stages.
  See \fBpace wellness-sleep(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBsleep\fP command.
.PP
\fBhr\fP
  Heart rate by minute.
  See \fBpace wellness-hr(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBhr\fP command.
.PP
\fBstress\fP
  Stress level metrics.
  See \fBpace wellness-stress(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBstress\fP command.
.PP
\fBbody-battery\fP
  Body battery (energy indicator).
  See \fBpace wellness-body-battery(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBbody-battery\fP command.
.PP
\fBhrv\fP
  Heart rate variability.
  See \fBpace wellness-hrv(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBhrv\fP command.
.PP
\fBhydration\fP
  Water intake for the day.
  See \fBpace wellness-hydration(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBhydration\fP command.
.PP
\fBtrend\fP
  Plot a metric over a date range (sparkline...
  See \fBpace wellness-trend(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBtrend\fP command.
.PP
\fBspo2\fP
  Blood oxygen saturation.
  See \fBpace wellness-spo2(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBspo2\fP command.
